resolution": "480x360"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/zDuJ0qmweo4/hqdefault.webp", "preference": -6, "id": "42"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/zDuJ0qmweo4/sddefault.jpg", "preference": -5, "id": "43"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/zDuJ0qmweo4/sddefault.webp", "preference": -4, "id": "44"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/zDuJ0qmweo4/hq720.jpg", "preference": -3, "id": "45"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/zDuJ0qmweo4/hq720.webp", "preference": -2, "id": "46"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/zDuJ0qmweo4/maxresdefault.jpg", "preference": -1, "id": "47"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/zDuJ0qmweo4/maxresdefault.webp", "preference": 0, "id": "48"}], "thumbnail": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/zDuJ0qmweo4/hqdefault.jpg?sqp=-oaymwEmCOADEOgC8quKqQMa8AEB-AH-BIAC4AOKAgwIABABGDEgVShyMA8=&rs=AOn4CLCr5SzbTR5XVVxwwhVck2Brf7utZA", "description": "This is a paper record a friend gave me. It's from The Prudential Insurance Company of America - a mutual life insurance company.\nIt is titled, \"Do you know your presidents?\". It has \"89138\" printed at the bottom left corner.\n \nWhen the paper is folded, the cardboard-paper measures 17.5 cm. The record itself measures aprox 8 cm from the center. Recorded at 33 1/3 RPM, it plays for almost five minutes.\nThe record grooves are printed in a thin layer of plastic which is glued to the paper. So this is actually a plastic record glued to paper. Some of this plastic continues onto the front page (on to the green portion at the beginning of this video) where you see it's peeling a bit. This plastic is thinner than tape.\nOn the record side, it is called \"Record Folder\". Patent pending U.C.C.  I don't known what those letters stand for.\n.", "channel_id": "UCkey0Bn12kP00mSALZ3nDkQ", "channel_url": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCkey0Bn12kP00mSALZ3nDkQ", "duration": 425, "view_count": 1324, "age_limit": 0, "webpage_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zDuJ0qmweo4", "categories": ["Science & Technology"], "ta